# FigDown — figures as text. Spec: https://github.com/FigDown/figdown
#
# Regression fixture for backlog item 66 (`TYPED-BLOCK-TITLE-CANVAS`): `timing` never
# had `table`'s 0.3 caption fix, so before `TYPED-BLOCK-TITLE-CANVAS` this fixture clipped
# its own title exactly like the bitfield case. One signal, four
# cycles: the smallest timing diagram a long title can outrun. See
# bitfield-long-title.fd in this directory for why this file lives here
# rather than under examples/.

figdown 0.1 timing

timing bus "Bus request/grant handshake under back-to-back contention"
signal req  0110
